flowchart TD
    A[Analyst triggers response action] --> B{Action in allowlist?}
    B -- No --> Z[Blocked - logged as failed]
    B -- Yes --> C{Severity meets minimum threshold?}
    C -- No --> Z
    C -- Yes --> D{Target is protected user/host/network?}
    D -- Yes --> Z
    D -- No --> E{simulation_mode = true?}
    E -- Yes --> F[Simulated execution - no real change]
    E -- No --> G{require_analyst_approval satisfied?}
    G -- No --> Z
    G -- Yes --> H[Real execution via automation module]
    F --> I[ResponseAction saved to DB]
    H --> I
    Z --> I
    I --> J[Audit log entry written]

    style F fill:#fff8e1
    style H fill:#fde2e2
    style Z fill:#f5f5f5
